  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear Participants,


    We are pleased to present this application, developed
    for research and educational purposes. Its aim is to explore the integration
    of gamification principles with habit-tracking functionalities, grounded in the
    theoretical insights derived from our initial questionnaire, "User Experience
    on Habit Trackers and Games'' Daily Quests."


    Our research has meticulously
    analyzed popular habits for tracking and has identified four key functionalities,
    which are incorporated into this application.


    Please be advised that this
    application is strictly for research purposes and should not be shared with any
    third parties or used for commercial purposes.


    We extend our heartfelt
    gratitude for your participation in testing this application. Your involvement
    is crucial for evaluating its performance and aiding in the completion of our
    research.


    Should you have any questions, please contact me via email at
    g0322202@iwate-u.ac.jp or through Discord: k.d.aize.


    Yours sincerely,

    Aize

    Researcher'
